   "zh": "他们是挪威人。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L015.mp4",
    "start": 23.9,
    "end": 27
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Customs officer",
   "en": "Your passports, please.",
   "zh": "请出示你们的护照。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L015.mp4",
    "start": 27,
    "end": 30.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Girls",
   "en": "Here they are.",
   "zh": "给您。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L015.mp4",
    "start": 30.2,
    "end": 33.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Customs officer",
   "en": "Are these your cases?",
   "zh": "这些是你们的箱子吗？",
   "audio": {
